      "title": "Explicit coloring certificates, exact verification, and certificate-relative extension analysis",
      "summary": "This program organizes explicit finite Schur-coloring certificates, exact verification, and local-extension analysis relative to the fixed Fredricksen–Sweet coloring through 536. It now includes the radius-60 conditioned SAT/LRAT method and qualified exclusion claim. Neither the radius-43 nor radius-60 work establishes a coloring through 537, a global impossibility result, an improved bound, or the value of S(6).",
